      "text": "OR operator :- implement OR operation in each bit of a number \nEG: \n(decimal 8) 1000 OR (decimal 10) 1010 -> 1010 (decimal 10)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OR operator :- implement OR operation in each bit of a number \nEG: \n(decimal 8) 1000 OR (decimal 10) 1010 -> 1010 (decimal 10)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
