      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "XOR operator : XOR is the logical operator which takes two inputs A and B and perform (NOT A ANd B OR A AND NOT B)\nEG: \n\n(decimal 4) 0100 XOR (decimal 5) 0101 -> 0001\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "XOR operator : XOR is the logical operator which takes two inputs A and B and perform (NOT A ANd B OR A AND NOT B)\nEG: \n\n(decimal 4) 0100 XOR (decimal 5) 0101 -> 0001\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
